<title>SINGAPORE: India tenders to buy kerosene for August delivery.</title>
<headline>India tenders to buy kerosene for August delivery.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has issued a tender to buy superior kerosene for delivery in August, industry sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender seeks 40,000-45,000-tonne cargoes for delivery to Madras or Haldia on the Indian east coast, cost-and-freight.</p>
<p>The tender closes on July 10 and offers will be valid until July 11.</p>
<p>In its tender for July deliveries, IOC purchased one 40,000-45,000 tonne cargo from Kuwait Petroleum Corp at 10 cents per barrel above MidEast spot quotes on a free-on-board basis.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3093)</p>
